# Mercury Goal Runner Harness — Cursor Rules

When the user asks you to build something, use the Mercury harness:

```bash
python .agentic-pi/runtime/run_goal.py --run-id <run_id> --command "what the user wants to build"
```

## Rules

1. Product files go to `output/<app-name>/`
2. Do NOT edit `.agentic-pi/` or `.agentic-runs/`
3. Do NOT claim DONE — the certifier decides
4. Check status: `python .agentic-pi/runtime/pi_cli.py goal-status <run_id>`
5. Health check: `python .agentic-pi/runtime/harness_health.py`
